Ported from ../outln/__tests__/cases/cli/033-mixed-explicit-ignored-file-is-kept.case.yaml; expected output is the TypeScript build's.
Its source-code inputs were rewritten as Markdown files.
input/.git/HEAD makes input a git repository: outln applies .gitignore files only inside one.
Except: the glob view says "a header or summary" instead of "header comments" (docs/changelog.md).
== args
input/src
input/src/generated.md
== file input/.git/HEAD
ref: refs/heads/main
== file input/.gitignore
generated.md
== file input/src/a.md
---
description: A summary.
---
# a
== file input/src/generated.md
---
description: Explicitly named, so listed despite .gitignore.
---
# generated
